data: {"id": "12b19224c0804e4e-thinking-parallel_evidence-1470", "run_id": "12b19224c0804e4e", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "现在结合已采集的所有事实进行总结：\n\n---\n\n## 已采集事实（2026-09-14T07:51Z 左右）\n\n### 1. Pod 当前身份与生命周期\n- **实体**: `aiops-case-v13/workload`, UID `60ae7d3a-d569-42e2-b19d-586b77d49885`, Pod IP `172.16.104.30`, Node `node2`\n- **容器**: `app` (image: `python:3-alpine`)\n- **容器状态**: Running, Ready=True, RestartCount=0\n- **deletionTimestamp**: `2026-09-14T08:48:57Z` — **已存在**\n- **finalizers**: **无** (`<none>`)\n- **terminationGracePeriodSeconds**: 3900s (65分钟)\n- **PreStop**: **无**（YAML中未定义 `lifecycle.preStop`）\n- **Pod 控制器 owner**:", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 5, "ts_ms": 1789372328853, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

